	(text_box "I moved all the I/O to one header\nThere are some notes:\n- 3.3V_LP is derived from a voltage divider attached to 48V_RAW\n	- It is always active\n	- Do not load it with any current! (max: 0.1mA)\n- Any of the EN pins can be bridged to 3.3V_LP to auto-enable\n- The PG pins are open drain outputs\n- 12V_PG is internally pulled up to 3.3V_LP"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
